TO DETERMINE WHETHER WRONG

00:00:04.263 --> 00:00:05.617
WRONGDOING DID OCCUR.

00:00:05.651 --> 00:00:07.301
NEW WARNINGS TONIGHT FROM THE

00:00:07.302 --> 00:00:09.752
ADMINISTRATION ABOUT THE THREAT

00:00:09.753 --> 00:00:11.348
FROM CHINA, TOP INTELLIGENCE

00:00:11.383 --> 00:00:14.064
OFFICIALS SAY THE THREAT IS A

00:00:14.065 --> 00:00:15.455
