00:00:15.489 --> 00:00:16.216
NATIONAL SECURITY CORRESPONDENT

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:17.121
JENNIFER GRIFFIN LOOKS AT THE

00:00:17.156 --> 00:00:18.867
EVIDENCE TONIGHT FROM THE

00:00:18.869 --> 00:00:19.622
PENTAGON.

00:00:19.656 --> 00:00:21.230
&gt;&gt; AMERICA’S OUTGOING

00:00:21.231 --> 00:00:21.914
INTELLIGENCE CHIEF

00:00:21.948 --> 00:00:23.253
JOHN RATCLIFFE IN A NEW OP-ED

00:00:23.288 --> 00:00:25.842
WARNS THAT CHINA IS THE GREATEST

00:00:25.843 --> 00:00:27.277
NATIONAL SECURITY THREAT FACED

00:00:27.311 --> 00:00:28.470
BY THE UNITED STATES SINCE

00:00:28.505 --> 00:00:29.619
WORLD WAR II.

00:00:29.621 --> 00:00:30.947
"THE INTELLIGENCE IS CLEAR:

00:00:30.982 --> 00:00:33.097
BEIJING INTENDS TO DOMINATE THE

00:00:33.098 --> 00:00:36.231
U.S. AND THE REST OF THE PLANET,

00:00:36.233 --> 00:00:37.236
ECONOMICALLY, MILITARILY, AND

00:00:37.238 --> 00:00:38.117
TECHNOLOGICALLY."

00:00:38.152 --> 00:00:39.800
RATCLIFFE SPOKE TO

00:00:39.801 --> 00:00:42.012
FOXNEWS.COM, CHINA IS THE ONLY

00:00:42.046 --> 00:00:43.434
COUNTRY CAPABLE OF CHALLENGING

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:44.751
AMERICAN SUPREMACY ACROSS THE

00:00:44.752 --> 00:00:45.383
BOARD.

00:00:45.417 --> 00:00:47.605
SUPPLY CHAIN ISSUES, FOREIGN

00:00:47.606 --> 00:00:48.983
INVESTMENTS, CYBER ISSUES, 5G,

00:00:48.984 --> 00:00:51.091
CHINA IS THE ONLY COUNTRY THAT

00:00:51.093 --> 00:00:52.523
THREATENS AMERICAN SUPREMACY.

00:00:52.557 --> 00:00:54.569
THE CHAIRMAN OF THE JOINT CHIEFS

00:00:54.603 --> 00:00:57.156
ECHOED THAT VIEW, AS WELL.

00:00:57.191 --> 00:00:58.992
&gt;&gt; THE LONGER-TERM, ALMOST

00:00:58.993 --> 00:00:59.938
EXISTENTIAL CHALLENGE, IS GOING

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:01.332
TO BE CHINA.

00:01:01.333 --> 00:01:02.300
IT JUST IS.

00:01:02.302 --> 00:01:03.915
WE HAVE TO COME TO GRIPS WITH

00:01:03.917 --> 00:01:04.116
THAT.

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:05.659
I’M NOT SAYING YOU HAVE TO HAVE

00:01:05.693 --> 00:01:07.030
A WAR WITH CHINA.

00:01:07.032 --> 00:01:08.435
I’M SAYING WE WANT TO PREVENT A

00:01:08.436 --> 00:01:09.870
WAR WITH CHINA.

00:01:09.904 --> 00:01:11.500
&gt;&gt; NATO IS SHIFTING ITS FOCUS

00:01:11.535 --> 00:01:12.563
BEYOND RUSSIA.

00:01:12.564 --> 00:01:14.297
&gt;&gt; CHINA DOES NOT SHARE OUR

00:01:14.298 --> 00:01:15.535
VALUES.

00:01:15.536 --> 00:01:17.798
IT UNDERMINES HUMAN RIGHTS.

00:01:17.832 --> 00:01:19.716
IT BELIEVES OTHER COUNTRIES.

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:21.392
&gt;&gt; THE CHINESE COMMUNIST PARTY

00:01:21.393 --> 00:01:23.544
CONTINUES ITS CRACKDOWN ON

00:01:23.545 --> 00:01:25.272
