00:01:25.307 --> 00:01:26.699
ACTIVISTS, JAILING 24-YEAR-OLD

00:01:26.734 --> 00:01:28.589
JOSHUA WONG, AGNES CHILD, AND

00:01:28.624 --> 00:01:30.971
