00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:39.469
PRISON FOR ORGANIZING PROTEST.

00:01:39.503 --> 00:01:41.148
CHINA’S DEFENSE BUDGET IS NOW

00:01:41.149 --> 00:01:42.281
THE SECOND LARGEST IN THE WORLD,

00:01:42.315 --> 00:01:44.105
THE NAVY THE LARGEST.

00:01:44.106 --> 00:01:45.733
&gt;&gt; THE CHINESE HAVE 25 SHIPYARDS

00:01:45.767 --> 00:01:46.952
TO OUR ONE.

00:01:46.987 --> 00:01:48.786
&gt;&gt; THE U.S. NAVY IS MORE LETHAL

00:01:48.820 --> 00:01:50.374
WITH MORE PRECISION WEAPONS.

00:01:50.375 --> 00:01:52.512
THE U.S. HAS 11 AIRCRAFT

00:01:52.546 --> 00:01:54.114
CARRIERS, COMPARED TO CHINA’S

00:01:54.149 --> 00:01:55.363
TWO, WHICH ARE SOVIET RELICS.

00:01:55.365 --> 00:01:56.747
THE STATE DEPARTMENT ANNOUNCED

00:01:56.748 --> 00:01:59.244
IT IS REDUCING VISITOR VISAS FOR

00:01:59.279 --> 00:02:00.215
CHINESE COMMUNIST PARTY MEMBERS,

00:02:00.249 --> 00:02:02.214
AND THEIR FAMILY MEMBERS, FROM

00:02:02.215 --> 00:02:04.804
TEN YEARS TO ONE MONTH, DUE TO

00:02:04.805 --> 00:02:06.363
THEIR "NEFARIOUS ACTIVITIES."

00:02:06.364 --> 00:02:08.452
MORE THAN 1,000 VISITING CHINESE

00:02:08.453 --> 00:02:10.283
RESEARCHERS LED THE U.S. SINCE

