JUSTICE DEPARTMENT, WHICH SAYS

00:02:13.531 --> 00:02:16.780
THEY BURROWED INTO U.S. RESEARCH

00:02:16.782 --> 00:02:18.172
LABS ON UNIVERSITY CAMPUSES AND

